Applicant, in view of the current further clarifying amendments to independent claim 1, traverses the rejection of independent claim 1 over the teachings of Berg. Berg, upon which the rejection of claim 1 solely relies, describes (in FIG. 3B specifically) a shirt including sensorsSVG
{EMBED HERE}
0.0770.047placed on the t-shirt to take measurements on the upper torso of a wearer. At no point does Berg specifically state that the disclosed arrangement provides a thoracic diaphragm signal.

